PROTOCOL IMPLEMENTATION
-----------------------

The Cast protocol support in this project is an independent implementation,
written against the publicly observable behaviour of the protocol and using
Chromium's Open Screen Library as a reference specification for wire formats.
No source code was copied from Chromium, from any Google Cast SDK, or from any
other Cast implementation.


